# Beer Pong Arcade - OpenGolfSim (FUSE Engine)

Complete developer documentation and architectural blueprint for the Beer Pong minigame.
For the complete engine architecture and traps guide, see [GAME_DEVELOPMENT_MASTER_GUIDE.md](../../GAME_DEVELOPMENT_MASTER_GUIDE.md).

## Quick Build & Deploy
```powershell
cd C:\Users\Daniel\Documents\GitHub\ogs\fuse
npm run build:examples

$dest = "C:\Users\Daniel\AppData\Roaming\opengolfsim-desktop\fuse\BeerPong"
Copy-Item -Path "dist\examples\assets\*" -Destination "$dest\assets" -Recurse -Force
$html = Get-Content "dist\examples\beer-pong\index.html" -Raw
$html = $html -replace '\.\./assets/', './assets/'
Set-Content -Path "$dest\index.html" -Value $html -Encoding utf8
```

## Key Engine Rules
1. **Always clear `ctx.golfBall.isShotActive = false` before calling `launchShot()`**:
   `GolfBall.reset()` does not reset `isShotActive`, so any manual freeze (like ball resting in cup) will permanently lock subsequent launches unless cleared explicitly.
2. **Path rewrite**: Rewrite `../assets/` to `./assets/` in `%APPDATA%\opengolfsim-desktop\fuse\BeerPong\index.html`.
3. **AppBridge**: Handles both browser debug mode (`app.appType === 'web'`) and hardware launch monitors (`app.on('shot', ...)`).
